---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="DTP — AI Readiness Board Briefing"
  description="A leadership-first DTP homepage concept for AI readiness, decision quality, proof of concept and MVP delivery."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="concept board-briefing">

    <!-- ─── HERO ─── -->
    <section class="brief-hero">
      <div class="hero-grid-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="ma-container brief-grid">

        <div class="brief-copy">
          <span class="brief-eyebrow">Leadership Briefing&ensp;/&ensp;AI Readiness</span>
          <h1>Most AI projects start in the wrong place.</h1>
          <p>Before you build another tool, leadership needs to know what people are already doing, where the risk sits, which opportunities are real, and what the organisation is ready to absorb.</p>
          <div class="ma-hero-actions">
            <a class="ma-btn ma-btn-mint" href="https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/f0762b9af6a94ed2add9818a4f3ca4e5@digitaltechnologypartner.ai/meetingtype/qc2lOXjEdkO6GkMS_jZJrQ2?anonymous" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a Discovery Call</a>
            <a class="ma-btn ma-btn-outline bb-btn-outline" href="#briefing-route">Read the route →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="board-note" role="complementary" aria-label="Board readiness memo">
          <div class="note-classification">
            <span class="ncl-label">Classification</span>
            <span class="ncl-value">Leadership / Operations</span>
            <span class="ncl-label">Prepared for</span>
            <span class="ncl-value">Executive review</span>
          </div>
          <div class="note-head">
            <span class="note-doc-id">DTP / AI READINESS MEMO</span>
            <b>AI Adoption Readiness</b>
          </div>
          <div class="note-body">
            <div class="note-row">
              <span>Current state</span>
              <strong>Experimentation without visibility</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="note-row">
              <span>Leadership risk</span>
              <strong>Decisions based on anecdotes</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="note-row">
              <span>Evidence gap</span>
              <strong>No adoption map, no impact baseline</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="note-row note-row-action">
              <span>Recommended</span>
              <strong>Evidence-led diagnostic before any build commitment</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="note-callout">
            The question is not “Can we build AI?” It is “What should we encourage, control, investigate, stop or prove next?”
          </div>
          <div class="note-footer">
            <span class="note-footer-org">Digital Technology Partner</span>
            <span class="note-status">ACTIVE</span>
          </div>
        </aside>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── THREE REALITIES ─── -->
    <section class="dark-band">
      <div class="ma-container band-grid">
        <article>
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Experimentation is already happening.</h3>
          <p>Teams are using AI in pockets, often faster than training, policy or operating models can keep up.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Leadership sees fragments.</h3>
          <p>A useful demo here, a risk there, a promising idea somewhere else. Not enough to make a coherent decision.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Build decisions get premature.</h3>
          <p>Without readiness evidence, companies overbuild, underinvest, or chase the loudest use case.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── DECISION ROUTE MAP ─── -->
    <section class="route-section" id="briefing-route">
      <div class="ma-container">
        <div class="route-intro">
          <span class="ma-section-tag">// decision_quality_first</span>
          <h2>Start with the leadership decision.</h2>
          <p>DTP helps you understand the adoption landscape first, then move into proof of concept, MVP or pilot only where there is enough evidence to justify it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="route-map">
          <!-- Connector line drawn via ::before on .route-cols -->
          <div class="route-cols">
            <div class="route-col">
              <div class="route-col-top">
                <div class="route-node"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="route-col-body">
                <div class="route-col-meta">
                  <span class="rc-num">01</span>
                  <span class="rc-phase">Entry point</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Readiness Snapshot</h3>
                <p>A low-friction entry point for directional signal and qualification.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="route-col">
              <div class="route-col-top">
                <div class="route-node"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="route-col-body">
                <div class="route-col-meta">
                  <span class="rc-num">02</span>
                  <span class="rc-phase">Evidence base</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Readiness Diagnostic</h3>
                <p>An evidence base leadership can trust before deciding what to encourage, control, investigate or stop.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="route-col">
              <div class="route-col-top">
                <div class="route-node"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="route-col-body">
                <div class="route-col-meta">
                  <span class="rc-num">03</span>
                  <span class="rc-phase">Leadership layer</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Readiness Advisory</h3>
                <p>Interpretation, challenge and leadership playback — not another dashboard dumped in your lap.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="route-col route-col-final">
              <div class="route-col-top">
                <div class="route-node route-node-final"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="route-col-body">
                <div class="route-col-meta">
                  <span class="rc-num">04</span>
                  <span class="rc-phase">Committed build</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Proof, MVP, pilot</h3>
                <p>Where the case is strong, we build the focused thing that proves value in the real operating environment.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── PROOF / CAPABILITIES ─── -->
    <section class="ma-section proof-section">
      <div class="ma-container">
        <div class="ma-section-header">
          <span class="ma-section-tag">// dtp_still_delivers_systems</span>
          <h2>Understanding first. Building second. Operating value throughout.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-cards">
          <article class="ma-card"><div class="ma-card-line"></div><h3>AI and automation delivery</h3><p>Agents, workflow tools, data pipelines, reporting systems, internal apps and proof-of-concept builds.</p></article>
          <article class="ma-card"><div class="ma-card-line"></div><h3>Leadership and operating model support</h3><p>Decision packs, adoption maps, governance boundaries, prioritised opportunities and implementation routes.</p></article>
          <article class="ma-card"><div class="ma-card-line"></div><h3>Product and pilot shaping</h3><p>We package the useful work into narrow pilots, clear success criteria and a route to scale if the evidence supports it.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── BOARD CHALLENGE ─── -->
    <section class="challenge-section">
      <div class="ma-container">
        <div class="challenge-header">
          <span class="ma-section-tag">// questions_we_make_answerable</span>
          <h2>The board challenge.</h2>
          <p>The useful AI questions are operational. Most organisations cannot answer them yet.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="challenge-list" role="list">
          <li class="challenge-item">
            <span class="ci-num">01</span>
            <p class="ci-question">Where is AI already being used inside the organisation?</p>
            <span class="ci-status">Unanswered</span>
          </li>
          <li class="challenge-item">
            <span class="ci-num">02</span>
            <p class="ci-question">Which use cases deserve encouragement — and which need control?</p>
            <span class="ci-status">Unanswered</span>
          </li>
          <li class="challenge-item">
            <span class="ci-num">03</span>
            <p class="ci-question">Where do capability and data gaps block real value?</p>
            <span class="ci-status">Unanswered</span>
          </li>
          <li class="challenge-item">
            <span class="ci-num">04</span>
            <p class="ci-question">What should we prove before committing to a larger build?</p>
            <span class="ci-status">Unanswered</span>
          </li>
          <li class="challenge-item">
            <span class="ci-num">05</span>
            <p class="ci-question">What does the operating model need to absorb the change?</p>
            <span class="ci-status">Unanswered</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <div class="challenge-resolution">
          <span>DTP makes these answerable.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── CTA ─── -->
    <section class="ma-cta">
      <div class="ma-container ma-cta-inner">
        <h2>Find out what AI should mean inside your organisation.</h2>
        <p>Not in general. Not in a vendor slide deck. In your teams, your risks and your operating reality.</p>
        <a class="ma-btn ma-btn-mint ma-btn-lg" href="https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/f0762b9af6a94ed2add9818a4f3ca4e5@digitaltechnologypartner.ai/meetingtype/qc2lOXjEdkO6GkMS_jZJrQ2?anonymous" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a Discovery Call</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* ── BASE ── */
  .board-briefing { background: #efeee8; color: #101115; }
  .board-briefing :global(.ma-header) { background: rgba(10,10,15,.94); }
  .board-briefing .ma-cta { background: var(--ma-bg); color: var(--ma-white); border-top: 1px solid var(--ma-border); padding: 7rem 0 8rem; }
  .board-briefing .ma-cta .ma-btn { margin-top: 2.25rem; }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .brief-hero {
    padding: 10rem 0 6.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(158deg, #efeee8 55%, #e5e3d7 100%);
    color: #101115;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Subtle document-grid geometry — barely there, but architectural */
  .hero-grid-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(16,17,21,.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(16,17,21,.035) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 80px 80px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .brief-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr;
    gap: 4.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .brief-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .7rem;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #626878;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }

  .brief-copy h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 7.5vw, 7rem);
    line-height: .97;
    letter-spacing: -.065em;
    color: #101115;
  }

  .brief-copy p {
    font-size: 1.22rem;
    max-width: 640px;
    color: #3e4352;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2.2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .bb-btn-outline {
    color: #101115 !important;
    border-color: rgba(16,17,21,.32) !important;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.22) !important;
  }
  .bb-btn-outline:hover {
    border-color: #101115 !important;
    color: #101115 !important;
  }

  /* ── BOARD NOTE: enriched memo artefact ── */
  .board-note {
    background: #fbfaf4;
    border: 1px solid rgba(16,17,21,.12);
    box-shadow:
      0 2px 6px rgba(16,17,21,.04),
      0 14px 44px rgba(16,17,21,.11),
      14px 16px 0 #c5c3b8;
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: #101115;
  }

  /* Dark classification header — document meta strip */
  .note-classification {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: .28rem .9rem;
    background: #101115;
    padding: .65rem 1.6rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .ncl-label {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .62rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.42);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .07em;
  }
  .ncl-value {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .62rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.82);
    letter-spacing: .02em;
  }

  .note-head {
    padding: 1.3rem 1.6rem .9rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(16,17,21,.12);
  }
  .note-doc-id {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .65rem;
    color: #626878;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    margin-bottom: .45rem;
  }
  .note-head b {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-display);
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #101115;
  }

  .note-body { padding: 0 1.6rem; }

  .note-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;
    gap: .75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(16,17,21,.09);
    padding: .82rem 0;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .note-row span {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .68rem;
    color: #6a6f7e;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .045em;
    padding-top: .1rem;
  }
  .note-row strong {
    font-size: .95rem;
    color: #101115;
    line-height: 1.38;
  }

  /* Action row — mint tint, no border */
  .note-row-action { border-bottom: none; }
  .note-row-action strong { color: #0d3a26; }

  .note-callout {
    margin: 0 1.6rem;
    background: rgba(0,229,160,.09);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--ma-mint);
    padding: .95rem 1.1rem;
    color: #1e3029;
    line-height: 1.58;
    font-size: .95rem;
  }

  .note-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: .75rem 1.6rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(16,17,21,.09);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .note-footer-org {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .62rem;
    color: #929aaa;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
  }
  .note-status {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .62rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: rgba(0,229,160,.12);
    color: #0a7850;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,.36);
    padding: .18rem .52rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
  }

  /* ── THREE REALITIES (dark band) ── */
  .dark-band {
    background: var(--ma-bg);
    color: var(--ma-white);
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }
  .band-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }
  .band-grid article {
    background: var(--ma-bg);
    padding: 2.2rem 2rem;
    min-height: 240px;
    transition: background .22s ease;
  }
  .band-grid article:hover { background: #0d0d14; }
  .band-grid span {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    color: var(--ma-mint);
    font-size: .76rem;
  }
  .band-grid h3 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    margin: 2.4rem 0 .75rem;
    color: var(--ma-white);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  .band-grid p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.68); line-height: 1.68; }

  /* ── DECISION ROUTE MAP ── */
  .route-section {
    background: #eaeae0;
    padding: 7rem 0 6.5rem;
  }

  .route-intro {
    max-width: 580px;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }
  .route-intro h2 {
    color: #101115;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.2vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.03;
    margin: .6rem 0 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
  }
  .route-intro p {
    color: #42485a;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
  }

  /* Four-column horizontal route map */
  .route-map { position: relative; }

  .route-cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Horizontal connector line through node centres */
  .route-cols::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 6px; /* vertically centred on the 14px nodes */
    left: calc(12.5% - 1px);
    right: calc(12.5% - 1px);
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ma-mint) 0%, rgba(0,229,160,.25) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .route-col-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }

  .route-node {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #eaeae0;
    border: 2px solid var(--ma-mint);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    transition: background var(--ma-transition), transform var(--ma-transition);
  }
  .route-col:hover .route-node { background: var(--ma-mint); transform: scale(1.25); }
  .route-node-final {
    background: var(--ma-mint);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(0,229,160,.18);
  }

  .route-col-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .7rem;
    margin-bottom: .55rem;
  }
  .rc-num {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .68rem;
    color: var(--ma-mint);
    letter-spacing: .05em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .rc-phase {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .65rem;
    color: #8a8f9e;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
  }

  .route-col-body h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #101115;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: .55rem;
    transition: color var(--ma-transition);
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
  }
  .route-col:hover h3 { color: #0a7850; }
  .route-col-body p {
    color: #4a5060;
    font-size: .93rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* ── PROOF SECTION ── */
  .proof-section { background: var(--ma-bg); }
  .proof-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 1.2rem; }
  .proof-section :global(.ma-card p) { color: rgba(255,255,255,.76); }

  /* ── BOARD CHALLENGE ── */
  .challenge-section {
    background: #16191f;
    color: #e8e6de;
    padding: 7rem 0 6rem;
  }

  .challenge-header { max-width: 520px; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
  .challenge-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.2vw, 5rem);
    color: #f0ede4;
    line-height: .97;
    letter-spacing: -.05em;
    margin: .7rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .challenge-header p {
    color: rgba(232,230,222,.65);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
  }

  /* Evidence audit list */
  .challenge-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(232,230,222,.1);
  }

  .challenge-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.5rem 1fr auto;
    gap: 0 2.2rem;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(232,230,222,.08);
    padding: 1.7rem 0;
    transition: background .18s ease;
  }
  .challenge-item:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.018); }

  .ci-num {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .68rem;
    color: var(--ma-mint);
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ci-question {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.8vw, 1.3rem);
    color: #e8e6de;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.38;
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(232,230,222,.14);
    padding-left: 2.2rem;
  }

  .ci-status {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-mono);
    font-size: .58rem;
    color: rgba(5,204,144,.82);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .07em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 1px solid rgba(5,204,144,.26);
    background: rgba(5,204,144,.07);
    padding: .3rem .48rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  /* Resolution line */
  .challenge-resolution {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,.25);
  }
  .challenge-resolution span {
    font-family: var(--ma-font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.8vw, 2.1rem);
    color: var(--ma-mint);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
  }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .brief-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
    .route-cols {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .route-cols::before { display: none; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .band-grid, .proof-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .route-cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .note-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .22rem; }
    .challenge-item { grid-template-columns: 2.8rem 1fr; }
    .ci-status { display: none; }
    .ci-question { padding-left: 1.4rem; }
  }
</style>
